# Placeholder so the assets/icons/ directory survives checkout.
#
# Git does not track empty directories. If a real icon asset is added here
# later, re-add the following to studio/pubspec.yaml under `flutter:` so the
# bundle picks it up:
#
#   assets:
#     - assets/icons/
#
# It was removed because nothing in lib/ references an image asset, and the
# declaration made `flutter analyze` fail on a clean CI checkout with
# asset_directory_does_not_exist.